          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total{namespace=\"flux-system\",result=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total{namespace=\"flux-system\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
